      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "同样，$\\{C,B,A\\}$和$\\{B,A,C\\}$是同一集合——由$A,B,C$三点组成的图形：\n$\\{C,B,A\\}=\\{B,A,C\\}$。",
      "id": null,
